rposes. But it's fundamentally misaligned with where our scarce resources should go. I'd give it maybe 20-30. It's not zero because the idea isn't crazy and could be pursued later or by someone else with more appropriate funding. But it doesn't clear my bar for committing lab implementation resources. Let me say 25.\n",
