l and severe.\n\n**Promise score:** From my vantage point, this is highly aligned. It's not a perfect solution (it doesn't cover logging per se, it's one component), but as a standalone infrastructure piece addressing documentation currency, it's very strong. I'd give it around 82-85. It's directly on-mission for compliance, well-scoped, and addresses a genuine regulatory risk. Not a 90+ because it's one component of a larger compliance picture and \"centralized\" carries operational risks, but it's clearly something I would back without hesitation in terms of direction.\n\nLet me settle on 84.\n",
