th a promise around 58-62. It's technically solid, addresses the regulation, but from my specific angle of speeding up and maintaining quality in prototyping, there are friction points (WORM rigidity during dev, centralization bottleneck, doesn't address per-system instrumentation which is where real engineering effort goes).\n",
